<title>SPAIN: BASKETBALL-SCHEDULE FOR EUROPEAN BASKETBALL CHAMPIONSHIPS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-SCHEDULE FOR EUROPEAN BASKETBALL CHAMPIONSHIPS.</headline>
<dateline>GERONA, Spain 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schedule of opening phase</p>
<p>games in the European Basketball Championships (all times gmt):</p>
<p>Group A, playing in Gerona:</p>
<p>25th June:</p>
<p> Bosnia vs Russia   1400</p>
<p> Greece vs Turkey   1600</p>
<p>26th June:</p>
<p> Turkey vs Bosnia   1400</p>
<p> Russia vs Greece   1600</p>
<p>27th June:</p>
<p> Russia vs Turkey   1400</p>
<p> Greece vs Bosnia   1600</p>
<p>Group B, playing in Gerona:</p>
<p>25th June:</p>
<p>Slovenia vs France  1830</p>
<p>Lithuania vs Israel 2030</p>
<p>26th June:</p>
<p>France vs Lithuania  1830</p>
<p> Israel vs Slovenia   2030</p>
<p>27th June:</p>
<p> France vs Israel     1830</p>
<p> Lithuania vs Slovenia   2030</p>
<p>Group C, playing in Badalona:</p>
<p>25th June:</p>
<p>  Latvia vs Italy	 1400</p>
<p> Yugoslavia vs Poland   1600</p>
<p>26th June:</p>
<p> Poland vs Latvia	 1400</p>
<p> Italy vs Yugoslavia    2030</p>
<p>27th June:</p>
<p> Yugosolavia vs Latvia   1600</p>
<p> Italy vs Poland	   2030</p>
<p>Group D, playing in Badalona:</p>
<p>25th June:</p>
<p> Ukraine vs Spain	 1830</p>
<p> Croatia vs Germany     2030</p>
<p>26th June:</p>
<p> Germany vs Ukraine     1600</p>
<p> Spain vs Croatia	 1830</p>
<p>27th June:</p>
<p> Croatia vs Ukraine     1400</p>
<p> Spain vs Germany	 1830</p>
<p>29th June - 1st July: second phase</p>
<p>4th July: quarter finals</p>
<p>5th July: semi finals</p>
<p>6th July: final</p>
</text>
